        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "常见场景：滚到某元素、聚焦 input、量尺寸、初始化依赖 DOM 的三方库（图表、编辑器）。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "value": "示例："
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "改数据后等 DOM 更新再读。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "this.msg = 'hello'\nthis.$nextTick(() => {\n  console.log(this.$refs.p.textContent) // 已是 hello\n})\n\n// Vue 3\nmsg.value = 'hello'\nawait nextTick()\nconsole.log(pRef.value.textContent)"
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "q-vue2-computed-watch",
      "navLabel": "computed vs watch",
      "question": "computed 与 watch 有何区别？watch 的 deep / immediate 各起什么作用？",
      "questionNote": "computed 算派生值且有缓存；watch 跑副作用。别用 watch 替代简单计算。",
      "answer": [
        [
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "value": "要点："
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "computed 缓存派生值，watch 跑副作用；别用 watch 替代简单计算。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "value": "computed："
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "适合派生状态，"
          },
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "value": "有缓存"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "，依赖不变不重算；可写 getter/setter。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "value": "watch："
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "适合副作用——发请求、写 localStorage、同步外部系统；能拿到新旧值。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "immediate: true"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "：注册后立刻跑一次；"
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "deep: true"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "：深听对象内部，开销更大，优先听具体字段。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "value": "示例："
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "computed 缓存与 watch 副作用的对比。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "computed: {\n  fullName() { return this.first + this.last } // 纯派生，有缓存\n},\nwatch: {\n  keyword: {\n    immediate: true, // 一进来就跑一次\n    handler(v) { this.fetch(v) } // 有副作用：发请求\n  }\n}"
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
